    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-and-click visual novel about a creature living underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows where you came from or why. It's dark and filthy all around as you crawl through self-dug tunnels, savoring your solitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yesterday you killed a mouse. You enjoyed it, yet something felt missing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tale of madness, loneliness, cruelty, and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll play as an underground dweller. What sustains it? Where did it originate? What does it crave?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items, navigate, and explore the depths of your subterranean shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A complete remake of the original 'I Live Under Your House'.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scene has been reworked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New dialogues added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save system implemented</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has grown darker and more visceral, fully realizing the author's original vision\u2014unachievable in the classic version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697030/extras/d26a4e86f0dede1120a785dd654238ff.poster.avif?t=1755158658\" width=546 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697030/extras/d26a4e86f0dede1120a785dd654238ff.webm?t=1755158658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697030/extras/d26a4e86f0dede1120a785dd654238ff.mp4?t=1755158658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point-and-click visual novel about a creature living underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows where you came from or why. It's dark and filthy all around as you crawl through self-dug tunnels, savoring your solitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yesterday you killed a mouse. You enjoyed it, yet something felt missing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tale of madness, loneliness, cruelty, and love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll play as an underground dweller. What sustains it? Where did it originate? What does it crave?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items, navigate, and explore the depths of your subterranean shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A complete remake of the original 'I Live Under Your House'.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every scene has been reworked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New dialogues added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save system implemented</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has grown darker and more visceral, fully realizing the author's original vision\u2014unachievable in the classic version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697030/extras/d26a4e86f0dede1120a785dd654238ff.poster.avif?t=1755158658\" width=546 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697030/extras/d26a4e86f0dede1120a785dd654238ff.webm?t=1755158658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697030/extras/d26a4e86f0dede1120a785dd654238ff.mp4?t=1755158658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
